      "widgets_values": [
        "How to use module 95:\n1.) Select an image\n2.) Run the workflow\n3.) Open the subgraph\n4.) Click \"Use current image\" above the image on the left\n5.) Open the mask editor by clicking on the image\n6.) Mask the area to be detailed and save the mask\n7.) Run the workflow\n\nThe mask editor can be reopened and the mask modified at any time—until a new image is loaded."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "How to use module 95:\n1.) Select an image\n2.) Run the workflow\n3.) Open the subgraph\n4.) Click \"Use current image\" above the image on the left\n5.) Open the mask editor by clicking on the image\n6.) Mask the area to be detailed and save the mask\n7.) Run the workflow\n\nThe mask editor can be reopened and the mask modified at any time—until a new image is loaded."
